276
00:20:48,996 --> 00:21:02,356
I keep turning things over again in my head, thinking about all I should have done, the things I should have said. What was even with that whole day, though?

277
00:21:04,356 --> 00:21:08,716
Are you... N-Nigorikawa?

278
00:21:09,636 --> 00:21:14,476
I am you, and so you are me. Imaginary Kiyotaro.

279
00:21:14,696 --> 00:21:17,236
I'm so obsessed, I've developed another personality.

280
00:21:17,236 --> 00:21:20,396
Think about it, about what happened yesterday.

281
00:21:23,556 --> 00:21:31,076
Not the pervy stuff. You said something rather important. Right there.

282
00:21:34,816 --> 00:21:37,276
I said, not now.

283
00:21:38,196 --> 00:21:43,116
You feel the power of it, don't you? Like you have a chance with her.

284
00:21:43,116 --> 00:21:53,276
Well, I mean of course I do. We even held hands and all that. That's basically commitment.

285
00:21:53,276 --> 00:22:01,036
But Yamada's always touchy-feely with her other friends, too. Maybe she's just treating me the same.

286
00:22:03,376 --> 00:22:04,416
What do you think?

287
00:22:04,736 --> 00:22:05,576
That could be.

288
00:22:05,656 --> 00:22:06,736
Don't agree with me!

289
00:22:07,276 --> 00:22:11,616
Why don't you try manning up and getting in shape? If she's still hanging all over you after that?

290
00:22:12,176 --> 00:22:14,356
Well, you know what that means.

291
00:22:14,356 --> 00:22:16,356
That means...

292
00:22:16,356 --> 00:22:30,556
All these emotions are Yamada's fault, right?

293
00:22:31,676 --> 00:22:33,236
Why do I always forget that?

294
00:22:33,976 --> 00:22:34,976
When she's around.

295
00:22:34,976 --> 00:22:41,676
Everything's fine.

296
00:22:41,836 --> 00:22:42,256
Though...

297
00:22:42,256 --> 00:22:42,616
You're there.

298
00:22:43,196 --> 00:22:44,676
It all comes back to me.

299
00:22:44,936 --> 00:22:45,296
See?

300
00:22:45,656 --> 00:22:46,176
Eventually.

301
00:22:46,716 --> 00:22:47,656
It's okay.

302
00:22:47,656 --> 00:22:47,756
Okay.

